{"_kind": "doc", "slug": "fa1zay1rncltoecw", "title": "120.Swift多模态模型训练", "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><h2 data-lake-id=\"JszGH\" id=\"JszGH\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc93614e6\" id=\"uc93614e6\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">示例代码</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u38cf5c77\" id=\"u38cf5c77\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"file\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.yuque.com%2Fattachments%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fzip%2F2424104%2F1747713193674-3cf846e1-c661-44ca-abaa-4e66f66ef686.zip%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22multi-modal.zip%22%2C%22size%22%3A2645%2C%22ext%22%3A%22zip%22%2C%22source%22%3A%22%22%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22download%22%3Atrue%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ue61c8fbd-71fc-4505-ad6a-cd7ba635b86%22%2C%22taskType%22%3A%22upload%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22application%2Fzip%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u1dd5ad05%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"MoGgj\" id=\"MoGgj\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6e1d451a\" id=\"u6e1d451a\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">环境准备</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u78ed840e\" id=\"u78ed840e\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua1f498ac\" id=\"ua1f498ac\">SWIFT介绍：</span><a href=\"https://modelscope.cn/docs/llm-training-and-inference/intro/quickstart\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u62b3ecfc\" id=\"u62b3ecfc\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0b98ff71\" id=\"u0b98ff71\">https://modelscope.cn/docs/llm-training-and-inference/intro/quickstart</span></a></p><p data-lake-id=\"u5dab92a9\" id=\"u5dab92a9\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5825d6a2\" id=\"u5825d6a2\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">推荐的第三方库版本参考</span><a href=\"https://modelscope.cn/docs/llm-training-and-inference/intro/swift-installation\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u4805945b\" id=\"u4805945b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u396724fc\" id=\"u396724fc\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-accent-fg)\">SWIFT安装文档</span></a></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22pip%20install%20ms-swift%20-U%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E8%8B%A5%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8deepspeed%20zero2%2Fzero3%5Cnpip%20install%20deepspeed%20-U%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uSsBo%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"Fh4ZR\" id=\"Fh4ZR\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1d6df27c\" id=\"u1d6df27c\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">微调训练</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u740c66d3\" id=\"u740c66d3\"><span data-lake-id=\"u637780e9\" id=\"u637780e9\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">ms-swift使用了分层式的设计思想，用户可以使用命令行界面、Web-UI界面和直接使用Python的方式进行微调。</span></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"S4OpK\" id=\"S4OpK\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue6cda9c5\" id=\"ue6cda9c5\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">使用CLI</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u82aff6eb\" id=\"u82aff6eb\"><span data-lake-id=\"u89547724\" id=\"u89547724\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">我们提供了10分钟在单卡3090上对Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct进行自我认知微调的最佳实践，具体参考</span><a href=\"https://modelscope.cn/docs/llm-training-and-inference/intro/quickstart\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u3a98fe37\" id=\"u3a98fe37\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6503677d\" id=\"u6503677d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-accent-fg)\">这里</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"uef90bb28\" id=\"uef90bb28\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">，这可以帮助您快速了解SWIFT。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u6f2eb438\" id=\"u6f2eb438\"><span data-lake-id=\"u20b98be0\" id=\"u20b98be0\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">此外，我们给出了一系列脚本帮助您了解SWIFT的训练能力：</span></p><ul list=\"uc86380e5\"><li fid=\"uc2bad711\" data-lake-id=\"udfa0df3d\" id=\"udfa0df3d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u268caa4b\" id=\"u268caa4b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">多模态训练：SWIFT支持多模态模型的预训练、微调和RLHF。支持Caption、VQA、OCR、</span><a href=\"https://github.com/modelscope/ms-swift/blob/main/examples/notebook/qwen2_5-vl-grounding/zh.ipynb\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"ufb420a9a\" id=\"ufb420a9a\"><span data-lake-id=\"uaacc0801\" id=\"uaacc0801\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-accent-fg)\">Grounding</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u4016e7e9\" id=\"u4016e7e9\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">任务。支持图像、视频和音频三种模态。具体参考</span><a href=\"https://github.com/modelscope/ms-swift/tree/main/examples/train/multimodal\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u4ac38597\" id=\"u4ac38597\"><span data-lake-id=\"u65da4b9d\" id=\"u65da4b9d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-accent-fg)\">这里</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u63182bdf\" id=\"u63182bdf\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">。多模态自定义数据集格式参考</span><a href=\"https://modelscope.cn/docs/llm-training-and-inference/customization/custom-dataset\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u48c18640\" id=\"u48c18640\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5ea6a5d2\" id=\"u5ea6a5d2\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-accent-fg)\">自定义数据集文档</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u61e5b0b1\" id=\"u61e5b0b1\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">。</span></li></ul><ul list=\"uc86380e5\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"u5439279c\" data-lake-id=\"u4cf7f912\" id=\"u4cf7f912\"><span data-lake-id=\"u14213e80\" id=\"u14213e80\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">对ViT/Aligner使用全参数训练，LLM使用LoRA训练，并采用不同学习率的例子参考</span><a href=\"https://github.com/modelscope/ms-swift/tree/main/examples/train/multimodal/lora_llm_full_vit\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u81791811\" id=\"u81791811\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue2ce9f6c\" id=\"ue2ce9f6c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-accent-fg)\">这里</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"uaed6f4e3\" id=\"uaed6f4e3\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">。</span></li><li fid=\"u5439279c\" data-lake-id=\"uceceda15\" id=\"uceceda15\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua675443b\" id=\"ua675443b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">多模态模型packing，增加训练速度，例子参考</span><a href=\"https://github.com/modelscope/ms-swift/tree/main/examples/train/packing\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u2a15e026\" id=\"u2a15e026\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc1cc0de6\" id=\"uc1cc0de6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-accent-fg)\">这里</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u17e3fc1d\" id=\"u17e3fc1d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"ud20699ec\" id=\"ud20699ec\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc3accd2e\" id=\"uc3accd2e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">小帖士：</span></p><ul list=\"u01d958e5\"><li fid=\"uc0dbd581\" data-lake-id=\"u8a98a30b\" id=\"u8a98a30b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u76f7b983\" id=\"u76f7b983\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">在使用</span><code data-lake-id=\"u8660f765\" id=\"u8660f765\"><span data-lake-id=\"u36d2a34d\" id=\"u36d2a34d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">swift sft</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u8dfd2ac5\" id=\"u8dfd2ac5\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">通过LoRA技术微调base模型为chat模型时，有时需要手动设置模板。通过添加</span><code data-lake-id=\"u2743b0e0\" id=\"u2743b0e0\"><span data-lake-id=\"ueb46f951\" id=\"ueb46f951\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">--template default</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u380a3a02\" id=\"u380a3a02\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">参数来避免base模型因未见过对话模板中的特殊字符而无法正常停止的情况。具体参考</span><a href=\"https://github.com/modelscope/ms-swift/tree/main/examples/train/base_to_chat\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"ua9e230e4\" id=\"ua9e230e4\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7a4e1e9b\" id=\"u7a4e1e9b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-accent-fg)\">这里</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u913c61c8\" id=\"u913c61c8\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">。</span></li><li fid=\"uc0dbd581\" data-lake-id=\"u6d9cd1c4\" id=\"u6d9cd1c4\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4f21c297\" id=\"u4f21c297\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">如果需要在</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u9bc142c3\" id=\"u9bc142c3\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">断网</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u33b85706\" id=\"u33b85706\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">环境下进行训练，请设置</span><code data-lake-id=\"u252b21a9\" id=\"u252b21a9\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0bae45fc\" id=\"u0bae45fc\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">--model &lt;model_dir&gt;</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ufc2f251a\" id=\"ufc2f251a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">和</span><code data-lake-id=\"u9d5b25d2\" id=\"u9d5b25d2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u925a6c1d\" id=\"u925a6c1d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">--check_model false</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u1ffb0c80\" id=\"u1ffb0c80\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">。如果对应的模型需要</span><code data-lake-id=\"u5a6c499a\" id=\"u5a6c499a\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub32711ed\" id=\"ub32711ed\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">git clone</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u7a19cbf3\" id=\"u7a19cbf3\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">github的仓库，例如</span><code data-lake-id=\"u5cc3b620\" id=\"u5cc3b620\"><span data-lake-id=\"uec8ee662\" id=\"uec8ee662\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">deepseek-ai/Janus-Pro-7B</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ua1e16338\" id=\"ua1e16338\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">，请设置手动下载仓库，并设置</span><code data-lake-id=\"u032291c6\" id=\"u032291c6\"><span data-lake-id=\"u72c793bc\" id=\"u72c793bc\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">--local_repo_path &lt;repo_dir&gt;</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uf1471668\" id=\"uf1471668\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">。具体参数含义请参考</span><a href=\"https://modelscope.cn/docs/llm-training-and-inference/user-guide/%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E8%A1%8C%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B0.md\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u7cc95b56\" id=\"u7cc95b56\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9b267bdb\" id=\"u9b267bdb\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-accent-fg)\">命令行参数文档</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"uef9dd7cf\" id=\"uef9dd7cf\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">。</span></li><li fid=\"uc0dbd581\" data-lake-id=\"uf3c063a9\" id=\"uf3c063a9\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0d7afd97\" id=\"u0d7afd97\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">如果使用NPU进行训练，只需要将shell中的</span><code data-lake-id=\"uf34687ea\" id=\"uf34687ea\"><span data-lake-id=\"udd44e354\" id=\"udd44e354\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u031c059d\" id=\"u031c059d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">修改为</span><code data-lake-id=\"u3217beae\" id=\"u3217beae\"><span data-lake-id=\"uec4813ce\" id=\"uec4813ce\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">ASCEND_RT_VISIBLE_DEVICES</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u419031b2\" id=\"u419031b2\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">。</span></li><li fid=\"uc0dbd581\" data-lake-id=\"u2a7df279\" id=\"u2a7df279\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf10e5362\" id=\"uf10e5362\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">SWIFT默认在训练时设置</span><code data-lake-id=\"u8e9fc416\" id=\"u8e9fc416\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0667850f\" id=\"u0667850f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">--gradient_checkpointing true</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u2dbc9e1e\" id=\"u2dbc9e1e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">来节约显存，这会略微降低训练速度。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"ua616c1ee\" id=\"ua616c1ee\"><br></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"Whw7y\" id=\"Whw7y\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8100534d\" id=\"u8100534d\">音频模型微调</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u70aef756\" id=\"u70aef756\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4940fd49\" id=\"u4940fd49\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">模型：</span><a href=\"https://modelscope.cn/models/Qwen/Qwen2-Audio-7B-Instruct\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u52e286ef\" id=\"u52e286ef\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2e0ed82c\" id=\"u2e0ed82c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">https://modelscope.cn/models/Qwen/Qwen2-Audio-7B-Instruct</span></a></p><p data-lake-id=\"ua9b377e8\" id=\"ua9b377e8\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6de7014f\" id=\"u6de7014f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">数据集：</span><a href=\"https://modelscope.cn/datasets/speech_asr/speech_asr_aishell1_trainsets\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u96364ef2\" id=\"u96364ef2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u60c23587\" id=\"u60c23587\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">https://modelscope.cn/datasets/speech_asr/speech_asr_aishell1_trainsets</span></a></p><p data-lake-id=\"uffb7bc7c\" id=\"uffb7bc7c\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufe534bdc\" id=\"ufe534bdc\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">Qwen2-Audio 是 Qwen 大型音频-语言模型的新系列。Qwen2-Audio 能够接受各种音频信号输入，并根据语音指令执行音频分析或直接文本响应。我们引入了两种不同的音频交互模式：</span></p><ul list=\"u42889856\"><li fid=\"u15c18ca1\" data-lake-id=\"u599c6f5a\" id=\"u599c6f5a\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud3be55e5\" id=\"ud3be55e5\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">语音聊天：用户可以在没有文本输入的情况下自由地与 Qwen2-Audio 进行语音互动；</span></li><li fid=\"u15c18ca1\" data-lake-id=\"u20f73483\" id=\"u20f73483\"><span data-lake-id=\"u16b2ba56\" id=\"u16b2ba56\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">音频分析：用户可以在互动过程中提供音频和文本指令进行分析；</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"u93f6d63c\" id=\"u93f6d63c\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud9a9d6a0\" id=\"ud9a9d6a0\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">我们发布了 Qwen2-Audio-7B 和 Qwen2-Audio-7B-Instruct，分别是预训练模型和聊天模型。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u6fc80eeb\" id=\"u6fc80eeb\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf37cf9ae\" id=\"uf37cf9ae\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u7438ab40\" id=\"u7438ab40\"><span data-lake-id=\"u65c68b12\" id=\"u65c68b12\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">​</span><br></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"xC2Bn\" id=\"xC2Bn\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6c38cdcc\" id=\"u6c38cdcc\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">图像模型微调</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"ua3d7f8a2\" id=\"ua3d7f8a2\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubac04f03\" id=\"ubac04f03\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">模型：</span><a href=\"https://modelscope.cn/models/Qwen/Qwen2.5-VL-7B-Instruct\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"uc6b694f9\" id=\"uc6b694f9\"><span data-lake-id=\"u25422e76\" id=\"u25422e76\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">https://modelscope.cn/models/Qwen/Qwen2.5-VL-7B-Instruct</span></a></p><p data-lake-id=\"udbc98e85\" id=\"udbc98e85\"><span data-lake-id=\"u55bf1b2f\" id=\"u55bf1b2f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">数据集：</span><a href=\"https://modelscope.cn/datasets/AI-ModelScope/LaTeX_OCR/file/view/master/human_handwrite%2Ftest-00000-of-00001.parquet?id=49715&amp;status=0\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"uf7fb5334\" id=\"uf7fb5334\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2544bde9\" id=\"u2544bde9\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">https://modelscope.cn/datasets/AI-ModelScope/LaTeX_OCR/file/view/master/human_handwrite%2Ftest-00000-of-00001.parquet?id=49715&amp;status=0</span></a></p><p data-lake-id=\"u5689c44d\" id=\"u5689c44d\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub06d6fea\" id=\"ub06d6fea\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">自从Qwen2-VL发布以来的五个月里，许多开发者在Qwen2-VL视觉-语言模型上构建了新的模型，并为我们提供了宝贵的反馈。在此期间，我们专注于构建更有用的视觉-语言模型。今天，我们非常激动地介绍Qwen家族的最新成员：Qwen2.5-VL。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u8eb0962a\" id=\"u8eb0962a\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u4021f02d\" id=\"u4021f02d\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">主要改进：</span></strong></p><ul list=\"u86ab4b6d\"><li fid=\"u3f1828cf\" data-lake-id=\"u6af24454\" id=\"u6af24454\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u6b2905bb\" id=\"u6b2905bb\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">视觉理解能力</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u864e3187\" id=\"u864e3187\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">：Qwen2.5-VL不仅擅长识别常见的物体如花、鸟、鱼和昆虫，而且在分析图像中的文本、图表、图标、图形和布局方面也非常出色。</span></li><li fid=\"u3f1828cf\" data-lake-id=\"u764f18bf\" id=\"u764f18bf\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"udc3f128b\" id=\"udc3f128b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">自主代理能力</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ua8db517a\" id=\"ua8db517a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">：Qwen2.5-VL可以直接作为视觉代理，能够进行推理并动态指导工具的使用，具备计算机和手机操作的能力。</span></li><li fid=\"u3f1828cf\" data-lake-id=\"u10406d6a\" id=\"u10406d6a\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ua77f9dcb\" id=\"ua77f9dcb\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">理解和捕捉长视频中的事件</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u03b0bfbc\" id=\"u03b0bfbc\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">：Qwen2.5-VL可以理解超过1小时的视频，并且这次新增了通过定位相关视频片段来捕捉事件的能力。</span></li><li fid=\"u3f1828cf\" data-lake-id=\"u7d302f77\" id=\"u7d302f77\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u09179d8d\" id=\"u09179d8d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">不同格式下的视觉定位能力</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ub1ef68a5\" id=\"ub1ef68a5\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">：Qwen2.5-VL可以通过生成边界框或点准确地在图像中定位物体，并能提供稳定的JSON输出，包括坐标和属性。</span></li><li fid=\"u3f1828cf\" data-lake-id=\"u7e3f96e1\" id=\"u7e3f96e1\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u89146499\" id=\"u89146499\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">生成结构化输出</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf26fcf2e\" id=\"uf26fcf2e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">：对于发票扫描件、表格等数据，Qwen2.5-VL支持其内容的结构化输出，适用于金融、商业等领域。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"ufa4661b4\" id=\"ufa4661b4\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uc3dc29b9\" id=\"uc3dc29b9\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">模型架构更新：</span></strong></p><ul list=\"u7ded57ac\"><li fid=\"uea6c396d\" data-lake-id=\"ub85a9ede\" id=\"ub85a9ede\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u493da946\" id=\"u493da946\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">用于视频理解的动态分辨率和帧率训练</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u7c3a5f72\" id=\"u7c3a5f72\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">：</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"u32e57f02\" id=\"u32e57f02\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8b90fb2b\" id=\"u8b90fb2b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">我们将动态分辨率扩展到时间维度，采用动态FPS采样，使模型能够在不同的采样率下理解视频。相应地，我们在时间维度上更新mRoPE，加入ID和绝对时间对齐，使模型能够学习时间序列和速度，最终获得精确定位特定时刻的能力。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u6f07c017\" id=\"u6f07c017\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fjpeg%2F2424104%2F1747299825239-68665081-7c07-4d4d-969a-c285c1a45099.jpeg%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ua03abb8c-e7ef-4dff-ab4b-09d17ff238b%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u8e9271fc-79ea-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22width%22%3A479%2C%22height%22%3A314%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A4579%2C%22originHeight%22%3A2999%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.5%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23eeddd9%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u8827aa22%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\"></card></p><ul list=\"u7041af60\"><li fid=\"ue48c21e9\" data-lake-id=\"u244a041b\" id=\"u244a041b\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u66bcecf4\" id=\"u66bcecf4\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">简化且高效的视觉编码器</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"u8face772\" id=\"u8face772\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7dcbaa4e\" id=\"u7dcbaa4e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">通过在ViT中策略性地实现窗口注意力机制，我们提高了训练和推理速度。进一步优化ViT架构，引入SwiGLU和RMSNorm，使其与Qwen2.5 LLM的结构保持一致。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uc37d5ff2\" id=\"uc37d5ff2\"><span data-lake-id=\"uca2c91e6\" id=\"uca2c91e6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">我们有三个模型，参数量分别为30亿、70亿和720亿。此仓库包含经过指令调优的70亿参数的Qwen2.5-VL模型。更多信息，请访问我们的</span><a href=\"https://qwenlm.github.io/blog/qwen2.5-vl/\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"uc61232c9\" id=\"uc61232c9\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue9e5f129\" id=\"ue9e5f129\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-accent-fg)\">博客</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u7d8d7093\" id=\"u7d8d7093\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">和</span><a href=\"https://github.com/QwenLM/Qwen2.5-VL\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"udab28754\" id=\"udab28754\"><span data-lake-id=\"u349d925a\" id=\"u349d925a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-accent-fg)\">GitHub</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"ue4be3b29\" id=\"ue4be3b29\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">。</span></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"KtvzK\" id=\"KtvzK\"><br></h3><p data-lake-id=\"ub5ce6d20\" id=\"ub5ce6d20\"><br></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"Z5kRo\" id=\"Z5kRo\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubf4ce7cb\" id=\"ubf4ce7cb\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">debug微调</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"uc9225ef1\" id=\"uc9225ef1\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub65778e4\" id=\"ub65778e4\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">你可以使用以下方式进行debug，这与使用命令行微调是等价的，但此方式不支持分布式。微调命令行运行入口可以查看</span><a href=\"https://github.com/modelscope/ms-swift/blob/main/swift/cli/sft.py\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u5aa65851\" id=\"u5aa65851\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2ead7f90\" id=\"u2ead7f90\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-accent-fg)\">这里</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u6e543817\" id=\"u6e543817\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20swift.llm%20import%20sft_main%2C%20TrainArguments%5Cnresult%20%3D%20sft_main(TrainArguments(%5Cn%20%20%20%20model%3D'Qwen%2FQwen2.5-7B-Instruct'%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20train_type%3D'lora'%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20dataset%3D%5B'AI-ModelScope%2Falpaca-gpt4-data-zh%23500'%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20'AI-ModelScope%2Falpaca-gpt4-data-en%23500'%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20'swift%2Fself-cognition%23500'%5D%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20torch_dtype%3D'bfloat16'%5Cn))%5Cnprint(result)%20%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YIwQ0%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ud0e570fb\" id=\"ud0e570fb\"><br></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"op0qP\" id=\"op0qP\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud923dc1c\" id=\"ud923dc1c\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">模型合并</span></h2><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20Since%20%60output%2Fvx-xxx%2Fcheckpoint-xxx%60%20is%20trained%20by%20swift%20and%20contains%20an%20%60args.json%60%20file%2C%5Cn%23%20there%20is%20no%20need%20to%20explicitly%20set%20%60--model%60%2C%20%60--system%60%2C%20etc.%2C%20as%20they%20will%20be%20automatically%20read.%5Cnswift%20export%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--adapters%20output%2Fvx-xxx%2Fcheckpoint-xxx%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--merge_lora%20true%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eUGQx%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u9bb65c75\" id=\"u9bb65c75\"><br></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"RrSgF\" id=\"RrSgF\"><span data-lake-id=\"u00a5ecbf\" id=\"u00a5ecbf\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">模型推理</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u72ccde66\" id=\"u72ccde66\"><span data-lake-id=\"u46d526d5\" id=\"u46d526d5\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">使用CLI对LoRA训练的checkpoint进行推理：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES%3D0%20%5C%5C%5Cnswift%20infer%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--adapters%20output%2Fvx-xxx%2Fcheckpoint-xxx%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--infer_backend%20pt%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--stream%20true%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--temperature%200%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--max_new_tokens%202048%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22usFdb%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><ul list=\"u4926ff8a\"><li fid=\"u6808bf71\" data-lake-id=\"u1a45d709\" id=\"u1a45d709\"><span data-lake-id=\"u12d808f5\" id=\"u12d808f5\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">adapters文件夹中包含了训练的参数文件</span><code data-lake-id=\"uec476fdf\" id=\"uec476fdf\"><span data-lake-id=\"u18a1ef0c\" id=\"u18a1ef0c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">args.json</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u3796caf4\" id=\"u3796caf4\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">，因此不需要额外指定</span><code data-lake-id=\"u08830ecb\" id=\"u08830ecb\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufd845910\" id=\"ufd845910\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">--model</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u8225bb27\" id=\"u8225bb27\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">，</span><code data-lake-id=\"u7e0eb13a\" id=\"u7e0eb13a\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc016f982\" id=\"uc016f982\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">--system</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u49087964\" id=\"u49087964\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">，swift会自动读取这些参数。如果要关闭此行为，可以设置</span><code data-lake-id=\"ud4806326\" id=\"ud4806326\"><span data-lake-id=\"u682b0bbf\" id=\"u682b0bbf\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">--load_args false</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u7a640e82\" id=\"u7a640e82\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">。</span></li><li fid=\"u6808bf71\" data-lake-id=\"ub9837040\" id=\"ub9837040\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1c4b4484\" id=\"u1c4b4484\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">如果使用全参数训练，请使用</span><code data-lake-id=\"u0f0f3f10\" id=\"u0f0f3f10\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4f9a1b1c\" id=\"u4f9a1b1c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">--model</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u83891b9d\" id=\"u83891b9d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">替代</span><code data-lake-id=\"u5f9d6ada\" id=\"u5f9d6ada\"><span data-lake-id=\"u35cf21da\" id=\"u35cf21da\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">--adapters</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u9d679d3a\" id=\"u9d679d3a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">指定训练的checkpoint目录。更多参考。</span></li><li fid=\"u6808bf71\" data-lake-id=\"u117d8afd\" id=\"u117d8afd\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3a44f182\" id=\"u3a44f182\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">你可以使用</span><code data-lake-id=\"uf4b341db\" id=\"uf4b341db\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4cdddaf2\" id=\"u4cdddaf2\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">swift app</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u608543c7\" id=\"u608543c7\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">替代</span><code data-lake-id=\"ua2c9ac02\" id=\"ua2c9ac02\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3bb1933b\" id=\"u3bb1933b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">swift infer</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ud2c17c6c\" id=\"ud2c17c6c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">进行界面推理。</span></li><li fid=\"u6808bf71\" data-lake-id=\"u9d01f95e\" id=\"u9d01f95e\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubc0acee5\" id=\"ubc0acee5\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">你可以选择对LoRA进行merge（额外指定</span><code data-lake-id=\"u0c98d83c\" id=\"u0c98d83c\"><span data-lake-id=\"uaa1c493e\" id=\"uaa1c493e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">--merge_lora true</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u0f69f101\" id=\"u0f69f101\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">），然后指定</span><code data-lake-id=\"uac519f6a\" id=\"uac519f6a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u33e91235\" id=\"u33e91235\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">--infer_backend vllm/lmdeploy</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u0e612e5f\" id=\"u0e612e5f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">进行推理加速。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"u2a543563\" id=\"u2a543563\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1258c4f7\" id=\"u1258c4f7\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">对数据集中的验证集进行批量推理：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES%3D0%20%5C%5C%5Cnswift%20infer%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--adapters%20output%2Fvx-xxx%2Fcheckpoint-xxx%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--infer_backend%20pt%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--temperature%200%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--max_new_tokens%202048%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--load_data_args%20true%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--max_batch_size%201%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Orrbu%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><ul list=\"u6a038822\"><li fid=\"u9353fec2\" data-lake-id=\"u7678510f\" id=\"u7678510f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u650ca4df\" id=\"u650ca4df\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">你可以设置</span><code data-lake-id=\"u7a1c826e\" id=\"u7a1c826e\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud4acbb0b\" id=\"ud4acbb0b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">--max_batch_size 8</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u4991a944\" id=\"u4991a944\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">，从而使用</span><code data-lake-id=\"uaa8aa218\" id=\"uaa8aa218\"><span data-lake-id=\"u53b18d04\" id=\"u53b18d04\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">--infer_backend pt</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u5745b316\" id=\"u5745b316\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">进行批量处理。若使用</span><code data-lake-id=\"u4b4760cd\" id=\"u4b4760cd\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf105ad26\" id=\"uf105ad26\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">infer_backend vllm/lmdeploy</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uf255fcb7\" id=\"uf255fcb7\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">则无需指定，会进行自动batch。</span></li><li fid=\"u9353fec2\" data-lake-id=\"u416c24d9\" id=\"u416c24d9\"><code data-lake-id=\"ue9cef198\" id=\"ue9cef198\"><span data-lake-id=\"ude9f5502\" id=\"ude9f5502\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">--load_data_args true</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ue7760252\" id=\"ue7760252\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">会额外读取训练存储参数文件</span><code data-lake-id=\"u0b8d56c5\" id=\"u0b8d56c5\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6dd4ff1e\" id=\"u6dd4ff1e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">args.json</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uf549abd9\" id=\"uf549abd9\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">中的数据参数。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"u88cfe5ee\" id=\"u88cfe5ee\"><span data-lake-id=\"u268ed78b\" id=\"u268ed78b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">若想对额外的测试集进行推理，而不使用训练时的验证集，使用</span><code data-lake-id=\"u7b70b4ca\" id=\"u7b70b4ca\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3c7d4f5e\" id=\"u3c7d4f5e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">--val_dataset &lt;dataset_path&gt;</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uc47b9bfd\" id=\"uc47b9bfd\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">进行推理：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES%3D0%20%5C%5C%5Cnswift%20infer%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--adapters%20output%2Fvx-xxx%2Fcheckpoint-xxx%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--infer_backend%20pt%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--temperature%200%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--max_new_tokens%202048%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--val_dataset%20%3Cdataset-path%3E%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--max_batch_size%201%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uL7bT%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"uabdd469f\" id=\"uabdd469f\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue71c4719\" id=\"ue71c4719\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">使用Python对训练后LoRA推理的例子如下：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22import%20os%5Cnos.environ%5B'CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES'%5D%20%3D%20'0'%5Cn%5Cnfrom%20swift.llm%20import%20(%5Cn%20%20%20%20PtEngine%2C%20RequestConfig%2C%20safe_snapshot_download%2C%20get_model_tokenizer%2C%20get_template%2C%20InferRequest%5Cn)%5Cnfrom%20swift.tuners%20import%20Swift%5Cn%23%20%E8%AF%B7%E8%B0%83%E6%95%B4%E4%B8%8B%E9%9D%A2%E5%87%A0%E8%A1%8C%5Cnmodel%20%3D%20'Qwen%2FQwen2.5-7B-Instruct'%5Cnlora_checkpoint%20%3D%20safe_snapshot_download('swift%2Ftest_lora')%20%20%23%20%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E6%88%90checkpoint_dir%5Cntemplate_type%20%3D%20None%20%20%23%20None%3A%20%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E5%AF%B9%E5%BA%94%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%BB%98%E8%AE%A4%E7%9A%84template_type%5Cndefault_system%20%3D%20%5C%22You%20are%20a%20helpful%20assistant.%5C%22%20%20%23%20None%3A%20%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E5%AF%B9%E5%BA%94%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%BB%98%E8%AE%A4%E7%9A%84default_system%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E5%8A%A0%E8%BD%BD%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E5%92%8C%E5%AF%B9%E8%AF%9D%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF%5Cnmodel%2C%20tokenizer%20%3D%20get_model_tokenizer(model)%5Cnmodel%20%3D%20Swift.from_pretrained(model%2C%20lora_checkpoint)%5Cntemplate_type%20%3D%20template_type%20or%20model.model_meta.template%5Cntemplate%20%3D%20get_template(template_type%2C%20tokenizer%2C%20default_system%3Ddefault_system)%5Cnengine%20%3D%20PtEngine.from_model_template(model%2C%20template%2C%20max_batch_size%3D2)%5Cnrequest_config%20%3D%20RequestConfig(max_tokens%3D512%2C%20temperature%3D0)%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E8%BF%99%E9%87%8C%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E4%BA%862%E4%B8%AAinfer_request%E6%9D%A5%E5%B1%95%E7%A4%BAbatch%E6%8E%A8%E7%90%86%5Cninfer_requests%20%3D%20%5B%5Cn%20%20%20%20InferRequest(messages%3D%5B%7B'role'%3A%20'user'%2C%20'content'%3A%20'who%20are%20you%3F'%7D%5D)%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20InferRequest(messages%3D%5B%7B'role'%3A%20'user'%2C%20'content'%3A%20'%E6%B5%99%E6%B1%9F%E7%9A%84%E7%9C%81%E4%BC%9A%E5%9C%A8%E5%93%AA%EF%BC%9F'%7D%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%7B'role'%3A%20'assistant'%2C%20'content'%3A%20'%E6%B5%99%E6%B1%9F%E7%9A%84%E7%9C%81%E4%BC%9A%E5%9C%A8%E5%93%AA%EF%BC%9F'%7D%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%7B'role'%3A%20'user'%2C%20'content'%3A%20'%E8%BF%99%E9%87%8C%E6%9C%89%E4%BB%80%E4%B9%88%E5%A5%BD%E5%90%83%E7%9A%84'%7D%2C%5D)%2C%5Cn%5D%5Cnresp_list%20%3D%20engine.infer(infer_requests%2C%20request_config)%5Cnquery0%20%3D%20infer_requests%5B0%5D.messages%5B0%5D%5B'content'%5D%5Cnprint(f'response0%3A%20%7Bresp_list%5B0%5D.choices%5B0%5D.message.content%7D')%5Cnprint(f'response1%3A%20%7Bresp_list%5B1%5D.choices%5B0%5D.message.content%7D')%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22G8NRO%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ua873fa1d\" id=\"ua873fa1d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u797c4b2f\" id=\"u797c4b2f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">​</span><br></p>", "format": "lake", "word_count": 2001, "description": "示例代码📎multi-modal.zip环境准备SWIFT介绍：https://modelscope.cn/docs/llm-training-and-inference/intro/quickstart推荐的第三方库版本参考SWIFT安装文档pip install ms-swift -U ...", "updated_at": "2025-05-20T03:53:18.000Z", "created_at": "2025-05-20T03:53:13.000Z", "id": 220384249, "status": 1}